menu "ToDoHelper: AI service"

    config TODOHELPER_AI_TIMEOUT_MS
        int "DeepSeek request timeout (ms)"
        range 5000 120000
        default 45000
        help
            Reasoner models can take a while; the UI stays responsive because the
            request runs in this component's worker task, not in the LVGL task.

    config TODOHELPER_AI_SAVE_HISTORY
        bool "Persist the conversation to storage by default"
        default n
        help
            Default for the NVS key `ai_save_hist`. When enabled the conversation
            is written to <storage>/todohelper/ai/chat_history.json.

endmenu
